  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Nestled on the borders of Eastern Lake and in the private Summer's Edge community is your family's next dream vacation at Memory Maker. <br><br>Memory Maker is a large 5-bedroom, 4-bath family home (with Tesla charger!). Just steps from the large, shaded community pool and the gated private beach access, your family will easily be accommodated. Updated furnishings throughout this beautiful home make it the perfect choice for premium comfort. Inside you will find generous living quarters, an open kitchen for entertaining and the perfect retreat for cocktails and sunsets! <br><br>Looking for some pool time? Just take a quick 20 second walk to the beautiful community pool that is heated year round. Just around the corner is the private/gated beach access. This is just a 2 minute walk from door to gate!<br><br>1st Floor:<br>Living space with TV and sofa sleeper<br>Bedroom 1: King bed with TV and private bath<br>Bedroom 2: 2 sets of twin-over-twin bunks<br>Bedroom 3: 2 twins and TV, shared bathroom with Bedroom 2.<br><br>2nd floor:<br>Open floor plan with full kitchen and dining for 10<br>Bedroom 4: king bed with TV and private bath<br>Balcony with open seating and Gulf views<br><br>3rd floor:<br>Master king suite with TV and private bath<br>Crow's nest style lookout on balcony with ample seating and daybed swing to enjoy Gulf views<br><br>Your stay at Memory Maker comes with Xplorie’s best activities! one ticket per day, per activity! (over $800 in nightly value) Tee off at Emerald Bay or Regatta Bay, zip through Baytowne Adventure Zone, and sail on the Sea Blaster Dolphin Cruise. Enjoy Big Kahuna’s Water Park, Black Light Mini Golf, and scenic bike rides with complimentary rentals. Explore 30A with ease and adventure!<br><br>-Portable crib (sheets not provided)<br>-Outdoor shower<br>-Gas Grill<br>-Tesla Charger<br><br>* Parking for 3 vehicles (1 vehicle in driveway; 2 on parallel parking pad)<br>* Golf carts are not allowed in the Summer's Edge community.<br>* Dog Friendly: If bringing a pet, an additional non-refundable pet fee will be added to your booking. Please contact us if you are bringing a dog. A maximum of 2 dogs is allowed at a maximum of 30 lbs. Please see our rental policies for further details.",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
          "title": "Remodeled 5BR/4BA, Pool, Gulf views, Tesla Charger + Free Attraction Tickets!"
        }
      ],
      "title": "About this property"
    },
