          {
            "date": "Aug 5, 2025",
            "id": "848eb184-e2ab-48b8-a517-aac0064b8bba",
            "locale": "en_US",
            "response": "Thank you for your wonderful feedback! We are so glad the property was a perfect fit for your large family and puppy. It is great to hear the community and beach proximity met your expectations. We would love to welcome you back anytime!\n\nRegards,\nBenchmark Management",
            "user": "VrboOwner"
          }
        ],
        "text": "Rating Details:\nThe property manager was very helpful.\nThe vacation rental was clean.\nI was very happy with the location.\nI was more than satisfied with the condition of the vacation rental.\nOverall, I recommend this vacation rental.\n\nReviewer Comments:\nThe property was perfect for our large family and puppy! The property was just as described and the community and proximity to the beach was perfect!",
        "title": "Perfect for a Family Vacation"
      },
      {
        "author": "Joshua K.",
        "date": "2025-07-28T07:03:00Z",
        "id": "6888ca4ab845db5243c7b77f",
        "label": "Okay",
        "locale": "en_US",
        "rating": 6,
        "responses": [
          {
            "date": "Aug 8, 2025",
            "id": "8e5d28fb-6f8c-46aa-a19f-131c0ebd05ed",
            "locale": "en_US",
            "response": "Thank you for your feedback! We are glad to hear you enjoyed your stay overall, but we are sorry to learn about the issues you encountered. We truly appreciate you bringing them to our attention. We have shared your comments with our housekeeping and maintenance teams to ensure the cleanliness and drainage concerns are addressed, and we will also have pest control follow up regarding the bug sighting. Your input helps us improve, and we hope to welcome you back for a smoother experience in the future!\n\nRegards,\nBenchmark Management",
            "user": "VrboOwner"
          }
        ],
        "text": "Rating Details:\nThe property manager was very helpful.\nThe vacation rental was clean.\nI was very happy with the location.\nI was satisfied with the condition of the vacation rental.\nOverall, I recommend this vacation rental.\n\nReviewer Comments:\nOverall, the place was great! We just had some minor problems while staying there: bottom floor was not as clean as the rest of the house, bottom floor bathtub wouldn’t drain properly, and we seen a large roach like bug upstairs near the kitchen.",
        "title": "Memory Maker"
      },
      {
        "author": "Margie H.",
        "date": "2025-04-05T16:22:18Z",
        "id": "67f16771ed75174471a062ca",
        "label": "Excellent",
        "locale": "en_US",
        "rating": 10,
        "responses": [
          {
            "date": "Apr 19, 2025",
            "id": "f20a568e-5a5d-447f-9b9d-c6b360c9171f",
            "locale": "en_us",
            "response": "Hi Margie!\n\nThank you so much for taking the time to leave such a thoughtful review. We're delighted to hear that you enjoyed your stay at Memory Maker and that the home’s cleanliness, functionality, and proximity to the pool and beach access all contributed to a great experience.\n\nWe appreciate your feedback regarding the beach area. We understand how important beach space is to our guests, and while we’re glad you were able to enjoy the convenience of the access, we also recognize the limitations that come with the surrounding private beach sections. Please know that we’re continuously exploring ways to enhance our guests’ beach experience and will share your comments with the appropriate teams.\n\nIt was a pleasure hosting you, and we hope to welcome you back again soon!\n\nWarm regards,\nBenchmark Management",
            "user": "VrboOwner"
          }
        ],
        "text": "We loved our stay at Memory Maker. The house is clean and functional, the location to the pool and beach access is wonderful. The only negative about the beach is that it is a very small section of beach we are allowed on due to private beaches on either side. The section of beach that we were allotted was very small and crowded.",
